{"1240920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gumbrawl", "steam_appid": 1240920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>GUMBRAWL</strong>, the galaxy’s favourite competitive obstacle course, at least according to our marketing department and one very defensive intern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/31bda340d750d13352ea6256f7d3f4f5.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/31bda340d750d13352ea6256f7d3f4f5.webm?t=1771853297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>PRESENTED TO YOU BY LUDENS LABS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, bash, and blunder <i>in first person</i> through a series of formidable minigames where everything is scientifically designed to go as poorly for you as possible. Up to four players compete across ever-shifting courses packed with traps, gadgets, and the occasional “safety feature” that seems oddly carnivorous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tokens by surviving (or at least being entertaining while not doing so). Spend them between rounds to upgrade your loadout: grapple hooks, cluster grenades, jet belts, boomerangs, the kind of equipment that makes our health and safety officers quietly sob in the break room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/42660aea3571eaf8d0d3660a563dbbd8.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" width=64 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/42660aea3571eaf8d0d3660a563dbbd8.webm?t=1771853297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every course is hand-crafted to offer that signature <strong>Gumbrawl-brand zest of peril</strong>: conveyor belts over pits, collapsing bridges, cannons that promote spontaneous re-evaluation of life choices. Spectators adore it. You probably won’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for glory, chaos, and the promise of prize money that may or may not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the lights and laughter, something’s humming in the walls, but we ask you to politely refrain from asking questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/6b82c4d6b3cfb4894b47b89f4d74b417.webp?t=1771853297\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/6b82c4d6b3cfb4894b47b89f4d74b417.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stop asking about that prize money too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>GUMBRAWL</strong>, the galaxy’s favourite competitive obstacle course, at least according to our marketing department and one very defensive intern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/31bda340d750d13352ea6256f7d3f4f5.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/31bda340d750d13352ea6256f7d3f4f5.webm?t=1771853297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>PRESENTED TO YOU BY LUDENS LABS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, bash, and blunder <i>in first person</i> through a series of formidable minigames where everything is scientifically designed to go as poorly for you as possible. Up to four players compete across ever-shifting courses packed with traps, gadgets, and the occasional “safety feature” that seems oddly carnivorous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tokens by surviving (or at least being entertaining while not doing so). Spend them between rounds to upgrade your loadout: grapple hooks, cluster grenades, jet belts, boomerangs, the kind of equipment that makes our health and safety officers quietly sob in the break room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/42660aea3571eaf8d0d3660a563dbbd8.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" width=64 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/42660aea3571eaf8d0d3660a563dbbd8.webm?t=1771853297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every course is hand-crafted to offer that signature <strong>Gumbrawl-brand zest of peril</strong>: conveyor belts over pits, collapsing bridges, cannons that promote spontaneous re-evaluation of life choices. Spectators adore it. You probably won’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for glory, chaos, and the promise of prize money that may or may not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the lights and laughter, something’s humming in the walls, but we ask you to politely refrain from asking questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/6b82c4d6b3cfb4894b47b89f4d74b417.webp?t=1771853297\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/6b82c4d6b3cfb4894b47b89f4d74b417.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stop asking about that prize money too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In Gumbrawl, up to four remarkably durable idiots compete in first-person obstacle courses built by people who’ve clearly not heard the words “5 day mandatory health &amp; safety course” in their lives. Earn tokens, cosmetics and mild existential dread along the way.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/d0dab3471ed9ec971fc7b19d9f399197bf22710b/header.jpg?t=1771853297", "capsule_image": "ht